# High-gap distillation: logs ephemeral; npz (qprobe/data) already covered by
# `data/` above. The pilot qprobe/probe.jsonl (1.6M) stays TRACKED as provenance.
# The SCALED artifacts are LARGE + fully regenerable (gen seed band 1.94e9 +
# probe_signal_density.py + build_splits.py, all documented): pools (218M),
# per-leg probe.jsonl, and the 12.7M split manifests are ignored.
measurement/high_gap_distillation/**/*.log
measurement/high_gap_distillation/scaled/
measurement/high_gap_distillation/manifest_*.jsonl

